{"server":"jp","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_07_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_07","title":"11:08P.M.","storyCode":"CB-7","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"56597e3426cb33c23ea42c73a3d38302372bd1187dcc297844fc8d0083f4693a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"混乱を極めた戦場に、モスティマが再び登場する。彼女は戦いに加わると、余裕をもって敵のリーダーを牽制した。 だが突如として砂嵐が出現する。鼠王が前触れもなく襲いかかり、皆を散らしていったのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ、はぁっ……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カポネ","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"まだだ。まだ終わっちゃいねぇぞ。ペンギン急便よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"キミたちって、何だかんだ言っても仲がいいんだね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カポネ","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クロワッサン","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょ、ウチの方に来んといてぇな！　ハンマーお見舞いしたるで。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ！　テメェ一体どっちの味方だ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"お、俺がやったんじゃないです！　あの天使が！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"えへ、ハズしちゃった。まぁいっか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアA","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"今のうちに——おっと！　お前、俺の方に向かってなにぶった切ろうとしてんだ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアB","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"悪い、俺やっぱりボスに従うべきだと思って！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアA","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"待て、俺もだぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアB","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"ナニっ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"なに寝てんだお前ら？　死んでねぇ奴はさっさと起きやがれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"は、はい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ねー部下にパワハラは良くないと思うけど？　ちゃんと傷病手当って完備してる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……状況は少し混乱しているが、要は黒服の連中を全部倒せばいいんだな？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"なんか本当にゴチャゴチャになってるね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"そうです——えっ！？　モスティマさん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"君たちも元気そうでなによりだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……なぜここに？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"ボスに来るよう言われてさ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カポネ","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、あの変なサンクタ人か。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"そこをどけ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——っ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"やれやれ、ちょっと冷静になろうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"ここで勝ったところで何の意味があるんだい？　お互い一歩引いた方がいいと思うけどね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアA","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"あの女、ボスの攻撃を受け止めた！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアB","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"違う！　あれはアーツユニットだ！　ボス、気をつけてください！　そいつは術師です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カポネ","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"……正面から当たるのを避けたのは正解だったな……。おい、まだ奴らに近づくなよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"……お前のようなサンクタは見たことがねぇ。いや、サルカズか？　お前は一体何なんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"普通のトランスポーターだけどね。そう見えない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"誤魔化すんじゃねぇぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"死ね——。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、ちょっと休憩……。って言って聞くような人じゃないか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"テメェ、ナメてんのか！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"みんな、変わりないみたいで良かったよ。前に会ったときからだいぶ経つよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、よそ見してんじゃねぇぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クロワッサン","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"せやなぁ、何年やったっけ？　それともまだ数ヶ月やった？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐあっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ソラ","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"毎日が充実してるから、時間なんて忘れちゃうもんね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"……だいたい四年三ヶ月だよ、モスティマ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"ふむ、じゃあ本当に久しぶりだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"——っ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"その顔はやめて。君がそんなシリアスな顔してると病気かと思ってしまうからね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっと！　これ感動の再会じゃないの！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"感動かどうかは置いといて、今は昔話している場合じゃないみたいだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"本当にここでやるつもりか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっとした運動にピッタリなだけさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……ならいい。手加減はしてやれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、もう一人のお客さんが私を待ってるんでね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ソラ","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"毎回見て思うんだけど、なんであんな軽くアーツユニット振っただけで、こんな天変地異みたいな効果が出るんだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クロワッサン","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"せやな。あのマフィアたちも、ポッカーンとしとるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ふーっ、今のうちにもうちょっと敵の数を減らしておくべき？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"どうした？　続けないのかい？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"……お前の腕は確かに凄まじいけどよ、そう簡単に逃げられると思うなよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなに殺気立つものじゃないよ。こんなの食後の運動なんだからさ——おや。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"な、なんだいまの、炎が固まっちまった？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"……イースくんが近くを通ったみたいだね。やっぱりさっさと決着をつけようか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"なにひとりでブツブツ言ってやがる？　相手は俺だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなに焦ったらダメだよ。ファミリーのボスとして、戦局をコントロールするのに良くないからね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ！　お前の余裕ぶっこいた態度は本当に頭に来るんだよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"アーツだ！　避けろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"お前が行っても邪魔になるだけだ。俺たちは残りのペンギン急便を片付けるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……私たちも軽く見られたものだ。彼らには教育が必要だな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クロワッサン","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"はいな！　いくでぇ——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"これがトランスポーター、モスティマ……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"トランスポーター……他社のトランスポーターってみんなこんな感じなのかな？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ、風が吹いてきた？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"——風？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"テキサス、撤退するんだ！　早く！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"分かった！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィア","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、まさか地震か！？　あの術師、何をした？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"まったく、年寄りは本当にせっかちなんだから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"逃がすか——。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ——。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カポネ","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、これはアーツだ、一旦退くぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"砂嵐？　こんなところで？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クロワッサン","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"なんや状況がおかしない！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ソラ","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"テキサスさん！　ここが出口です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"バイソンとモスティマは？　うっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"砂嵐ではぐれちゃった、あたし見てくる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"待て、エクシア！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——っ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"まったく、モスティマが関わるとすぐ頭がのぼせ上がるな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"テキサスさん！　モスティマさん！　皆さんどこですか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、目に砂が——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"慌てないで。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"バイソン","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"モスティマさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"口と鼻を覆い隠して、私についてきて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"モスティマ","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"……それにしても、こんな近い距離で感じると、確かに下手に怒らせてはいけないご老人だと実感するよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアA","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"地面が、地面が崩れる！　流砂だ、退がれ！　飲み込まれるな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアB","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"ボス！　ご指示を！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"他の奴は！　カポネは！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアA","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"砂嵐に乗じて脱出したようです。こちらの人間で向こうのチームに混じっている者も……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"マフィアB","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"ボス！　ここも崩れます！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"……引くぞ、まだ機会はある。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガンビーノ","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"クソが！　いったい何が起こったんだ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"機会。機会……か……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"おかしいのぉ……。ワシはお主らに機会なんぞ残してやった記憶はないのだが？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["ソラ"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["クロワッサン"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["モスティマ"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["バイソン"]}]}
